  "snippet": "## Temperature Graph\n\n°F\n\nAvg. Hi\n\nAvg. Lo\n\nActual Hi\n\nActual Lo\n\nForecast Hi\n\nForecast Lo\n\n Temporarily Unavailable \n\n## May Weather in Tokyo\n\n Tokyo's May 2026 forecast shows daily high temperatures ranging from 66° to 84°, with overnight lows between 58° and 69°. The average high for May is 79° with an average low of 66°. AccuWeather's monthly forecast extends further ahead than any other source, with day-by-day RealFeel® Temperatures giving a complete picture of how May weather will actually feel in Tokyo. See also: June | July | August. \n\n## Further Ahead\n\n### June 2026### July 2026### August 2026\n\n## Around the Globe\n\n### Hurricane Tracker### Severe Weather### Radar & Maps### News### Video\n\nTop Stories [...] 26 72° 51°27 70° 56°28 76° 54°29 69° 57°30 61° 56°1 68° 51°2 82° 53°3 78° 61°4 83° 67°5 75° 56°6 71° 59°7 79° 61°8 77° 64°9 75° 61°10 77° 58°11 78° 61°12 78° 61°13 81° 60°14 78° 60°15 75° 56°16 81° 59°17 86° 60°18 85° 62°19 83° 66°20 85° 67°21 73° 60°22 N/A23 Image 3: Cloudy 66° 58°24 Image 4: Cloudy 72° 63°25 Image 5: Sun and areas of high clouds 82° 65°26 Image 6: Sun and areas of high clouds 81° 67°27 Image 7: Increasing clouds and humid 80° 67°28 Image 8: Increasing clouds and humid 78° 69°29 Image 9: A little afternoon rain 82° 66°30 Image 10: Partly sunny and humid 83° 65°31 Image 11: A couple of afternoon showers 84° 68°1 Image 12: Partly sunny and humid 80° 65°2 Image 13: Sun and areas of high clouds 80° 66°3 Image 14: A little afternoon rain 82° 67°4 Image 15: Increasing clouds [...] Let's Go\n\n Have an account already? Log In\n\nsettings\n\nHelp\n\nTokyo, Tokyo Weather\n\nTodayWinterCastLocal {stormName} TrackerHourly10-DayRadarMinuteCast®MonthlyAir QualityHealth & Activities\n\n## Around the Globe\n\n### Hurricane Tracker### Severe Weather### Radar & Maps\n\nNews\n\n### News & Features### Astronomy### Business### Climate### Health### Recreation### Sports### Travel\n\nFor Business\n\n### Warnings### Da